comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/unit/test_snapshot_gc_trigger.py:1-11` — Preserve operation-linked cleanup. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_snapshot_janitor.py:throughout; strongest 336-346, 525-533, 650-663, 700-738, 876-885` — Preserve reclamation and concurrency behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_snapshot_present_sha_no_fetch.py:1-16, 48-58` — Preserve no-fetch behavior for present objects. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_snapshot_targeted_fetch.py:1-14, 45-51` — Preserve ref-scoped fetching. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_spawn_detached.py:1-14` — Preserve detached-child cleanup and lifetime. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_step_failures.py:1-15` — Preserve summarized nonfatal failures. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_store_batch_write.py:1-13` — Preserve atomic batched writes. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_store_commit_maintenance_bd66.py:1-21` — Preserve commit behavior under foreground maintenance. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_store_copy_needs_env_id.py:1-24` — Preserve identity requirement for copied stores. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_store_sync_reconverge.py:1-11, 183-197` — Preserve untracked-path reconvergence. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_store_write_git_timeout_c2ba.py:1-17` — Preserve bounded lock-held Git calls. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_store_write_index_reset_on_failure.py:1-10` — Preserve index cleanup after failed writes. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_store_write_unmerged_recovery.py:1-10, 127-132` — Preserve recoverable unmerged-state handling. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_structured_matrix_scorer.py:1-13` — Preserve offline measurement scoring. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_structured_run_seam.py:1-15` — Preserve execution-module boundary. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_structured_run.py:1-12, 168-173` — Preserve raw-reply artifact behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_structured.py:86-150, 432-479, 570-733` — Preserve structured-output edge cases. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_subcall_class_selection.py:1-26 and provenance tutorials throughout` — Preserve model-class selection and provenance. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/test_snapshot_gc_trigger.py tests/unit/test_snapshot_janitor.py tests/unit/test_snapshot_present_sha_no_fetch.py tests/unit/test_snapshot_targeted_fetch.py tests/unit/test_spawn_detached.py tests/unit/test_step_failures.py tests/unit/test_store_batch_write.py tests/unit/test_store_commit_maintenance_bd66.py tests/unit/test_store_copy_needs_env_id.py tests/unit/test_store_sync_reconverge.py tests/unit/test_store_write_git_timeout_c2ba.py tests/unit/tes